        <p class="body-text" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">You provide a tech pack. We source all materials — fabric, buttons, zips, interlining, labels — and produce exactly to your specification. Your brand name on every label and package.</p>
        <p class="body-text" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;"><strong style="color: #fff;">Best for:</strong> Brands with finalized designs and a clear product vision. Maximum control over the finished garment.</p>
        <p class="body-text"><strong style="color: #fff;">What you need:</strong> A completed tech pack with measurements, construction details, material spec, and Pantone or fabric references.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cell" style="padding: 2.5rem; border-top: 3px solid #666;">
        <p class="label">ODM / Private Label</p>
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 400; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Design &amp; Manufacture</h3>
        <p class="body-text" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">Start from a brief, mood board, or reference garment. Our pattern team develops the design, you review and approve proto samples, we produce under your brand label.</p>
        <p class="body-text" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;"><strong style="color: #fff;">Best for:</strong> Brands in early development, or those without in-house design or pattern-making resources.</p>
        <p class="body-text"><strong style="color: #fff;">What you need:</strong> A clear brief — garment category, target customer, style references, and any material or certification preferences.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cell" style="padding: 2.5rem; border-top: 3px solid #444;">
        <p class="label">CMT</p>
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 400; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Cut Make Trim</h3>
        <p class="body-text" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">You supply the fabric. We cut, sew, and finish to your pattern and spec. You retain full control over raw materials and their source.</p>
        <p class="body-text" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;"><strong style="color: #fff;">Best for:</strong> Brands with established fabric suppliers and their own supply chain who want a reliable sewing partner without handing over materials sourcing.</p>
        <p class="body-text"><strong style="color: #fff;">What you need:</strong> Finished fabric delivered to our facility, plus a pattern and spec sheet.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

